idence.\n\nIF INCOMPLETE, WHY:\nWhole-file/history coverage and trusted execution proofs remain incomplete. Supplied HTTP 503/504 failures, malformed/unaccepted ingestion units, truncated deliveries and the unwritten Mercury ledger remain diagnostics—not code verdicts or test results.","identity":{"status":"verified","authority":"provider_response_sse","reason":"every_response_model_matches"},"termination":"stop"}
